# Added during the migration into OpenBot (2026-10-11).
#
# Upstream kept these rules in the OpenMuse repo-root .gitignore, and a
# `subtree split` only carries what is inside apps/mobile — so the rules did not
# travel with the code. Without them, `git add` here would sweep in node_modules,
# generated native projects (.expo/ios/android) and local .env files.
#
# The OpenBot root .gitignore already covers `node_modules` and `**/dist/`
# repo-wide; the patterns below are repeated so this package stays safe on its
# own (it is deliberately not part of the bun workspace, see MIGRATION.md).

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
build/

# Native projects generated by `expo prebuild` / `expo run:ios|android`.
# Upstream ignored these as apps/mobile/ios and apps/mobile/android.
ios/
android/

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
artifacts/
